usage: llm_local_tool [-h] --base BASE [--host HOST] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                      [subcommand] ...

Local LLM management tool

positional arguments:
  subcommand
  args

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --base BASE
  --host HOST        Prefer this host when resolving a local model (for
                     example framemoowork or moosacrem1promax)
  --timeout TIMEOUT  HTTP timeout in seconds for test requests
